  worker he takes her assistant hostage  like we are the 99 he runs out of there  and it's a big man hunt it's daryl who  finds him sorry man but you're under  arrest sebastian milton was right behind  him though and daryl's like hey let's  say you caught this guy you take the  glory and i'll score some points with  you so this guy's going to jail but he's  like hey i'm the first of many we're  starting a worker's revolution and  pamela milton does not like that  rosita's tasked with interrogating the  wait staff pitting her against magna  will our group be split up on opposite  sides of this revolution for now a few  days later after helping out sebastian  milton daryl's made a full-on  stormtrooper and got a nicer apartment  for his family but they're not fighting  zombies right now their main task is to  root out this potential workers  conspiracy and rosita finds a secret  room with all sorts of like graffiti and  stuff including this one that kind of  looks like heisenberg from breaking bad  so get ready for some class warfare in  the commonwealth and that's where  episode 10 comes to an end  hit that subscribe button for more of  the best recaps of tvn movies and check  out the join button to support the  channel as a member
 

